27 NVIDIA guided Q3 FY2027 revenue to $108.0 billion, plus or minus 2%, assuming no Data Center compute revenue from China. handover ['evidence', 'candidates', 'dropped', 'new_groups']\ne2848 1116 [('v9', 1116)] gnews:d949d26fe875780037064b8a NVIDIA guided to third-quarter revenue of $108 billion, with some revenue expected from Rubin GPUs. handover ['evidence', 'candidates', 'dropped', 'new_groups']\ne3219 1189 [('v9', 1189)] gnews:387b486b6e29491b9c8506df Daniel Sparks calculated that FY2027 Q3 Data Center revenue would be $99.9 billion if its share of total revenue stayed at FY2027 Q2's 92.5%. handover ['evidence', 'candidates', 'dropped', 'new_groups']\ne3222 1189 [('v9', 1189)] gnews:387b486b6e29491b9c8506df NVIDIA said hyperscale-business growth should reaccelerate in FY2027 Q4 as Vera Rubin supply builds. handover ['evidence', 'candidates', 'dropped', 'new_groups']\ne4761 1715 [('v14', 1715)] gnews:9fd93b942948c5002e13eb0b Manali Pradhan forecast NVIDIA fiscal Q3 2027 revenue of around $113 billion to $114 billion. handover ['evidence', 'candidates', 'dropped', 'new_groups']\ne4762 1715 [('v14', 1715)] gnews:9fd93b942948c5002e13eb0b Manali Pradhan said NVIDIA exceeded the high end of revenue guidance in each of the past 12 quarters, averaging 3.1% above the high end over the past four quarters. handover ['evidence', 'candidates', 'dropped', 'new_groups']\n   evidence {'id': 'e3', 'quote': 'Nvidia has exceeded the high end of its revenue guidance in each of the past 12 quarters. Over the past four quarters, actual revenue has averaged 3.1% above the high end of guidance.', 'one_line': 'Manali Pradhan said NVIDIA exceeded the high end of revenue guidance in each of the past 12 quarters, averaging 3.1% above the high end over the past four quarters.', 'speaker': 'Manali Pradhan, CFA', 'original_who': 'Manali Pradhan, CFA', 'original_day': '2026-09-15', 'tier': 'third_party_view', 'event_time': 'Past 12 quarters; average over past four quarters', 'links': ['v14']}\n archive 8011 extract 6243\ne976 537 [('v9', 537)] gnews:bdd09874d53aef7b27866d44 SemiAnalysis forecast that NVIDIA Data Center revenue in the second half of FY2027 would exceed analyst estimates by 20%. handover ['evidence', 'candidates', 'dropped', 'new_groups']\n   evidence {'id': 'e5', 'quote': \"And even though SemiAnalysis reported the delays, it's still bullish on Nvidia, forecasting that the chipmaker's data center revenue will exceed analyst estimates by 20% in the second half of its fiscal 2027.\", 'one_line': 'SemiAnalysis forecast that NVIDIA Data Center revenue in the second half of FY2027 would exceed analyst estimates by 20%.', 'speaker': 'fool.com author Lyle Daly', 'original_who': 'SemiAnalysis', 'original_day': '', 'tier': 'third_party_view', 'event_time': 'Second half of FY2027', 'links': ['v9']}\n archive 1736 extract 2937\ne4995 1824 [('v9', 1824)] gnews:ad94c78d09fe41fc3f29bbca NVIDIA generated $164 billion in Data Center segment revenue in the first six months of FY2027. handover ['evidence', 'candidates', 'dropped', 'new_groups']\ne2620 1076 [('v29', 1076)] edgar:NVDA:0001045810-26-000075:nvda-20260726.htm NVIDIA reported $99 billion of equity investments and $25 billion of equity investment commitments as of 2026-07-26. handover ['evidence', 'candidates', 'dropped', 'new_groups']\n   evidence {'id': 'e14', 'quote': 'These include equity investments of $99 billion and equity investment commitments of $25 billion as of July 26, 2026.', 'one_line': 'NVIDIA reported $99 billion of equity investments and $25 billion of equity investment commitments as of 2026-07-26.', 'speaker': 'NVIDIA Corporation', 'original_who': 'NVIDIA Corporation', 'original_day': '2026-08-26', 'tier': 'fact', 'event_time': 'As of 2026-07-26', 'links': ['v29']}\n archive 4485 extract 12803\ne2889 1121 [('v29', 1121)] gnews:aec1fae1b903de5c43ba7fdf NVIDIA said on Wednesday that it has $18 billion committed to equity investments for the remainder of its fiscal year, in addition to $47.9 billion held in private companies. handover ['evidence', 'candidates', 'dropped', 'new_groups']\ne3934 1409 [('v29', 1409)] gnews:67a905d722fae62095fd741e NVIDIA is reportedly discussing an approximately $2.5 billion investment in Thinking Machines Lab; no completion date is stated. handover ['evidence', 'candidates', 'dropped', 'new_groups']\ne4648 1661 [('v29', 1661)] gnews:767d795fbdf40bc90ce11e15 People familiar with discussions told Reuters that Nvidia could invest up to $10 billion in Anthropic’s potential IPO. handover ['evidence', 'candidates', 'dropped', 'new_groups']\ne4729 1697 [('v29', 1697)] gnews:6261d9e9a1fe8d22c05f5e82 NVIDIA spent more than $42 billion buying equity stakes in other companies in the first half of FY2027, versus about $1.2 billion in the prior-year first half. handover ['evidence', 'candidates', 'dropped', 'new_groups']\ne5011 1832 [('v29', 1832)] gnews:2052184744bec4b89ecab744 NVIDIA has invested in Cohere; Cohere is in talks to raise up to $3 billion. handover ['evidence', 'candidates', 'dropped', 'new_groups']\ne1926 879 [('v6', 879)] gnews:1219126db2e6631aa1264142 Bank of America said analyst consensus for hyperscalers’ calendar 2027 spending rose from $480 billion in August 2025 to $1.08 trillion in August 2026, an increase of about 127%. handover ['evidence', 'candidates', 'dropped', 'new_groups']\ne2535 1072 [('v5', 1072), ('v6', 1072), ('v9', 1072)] truenorth:transcript:NVDA:2026-08-26 NVIDIA said cloud-industry backlog exceeded $2 trillion and top-five hyperscaler capital expenditures were expected to approach $800 billion in 2026 and $1.3 trillion in 2027. handover ['evidence', 'candidates', 'dropped', 'new_groups']\ne1786 843 [('v5', 843), ('v6', 843)] gnews:c8ac167e2356a75994ebc26f Amazon, Meta Platforms, Microsoft, and Alphabet indicated they expect combined AI-infrastructure spending to exceed $730 billion in calendar 2026 and increase in calendar 2027. handover ['evidence', 'candidates', 'dropped', 'new_g